    trait_group_with_sugar_unwired_and_from_aot_if_val_2026-08-09, 0, "2026-11-28 Lane D (work/p2-app-lib-fixes-20261128): added pub trait group header/body support in src/app/desugar/{trait_scanner,trait_desugar}.spl, fixed portable binary resolution in test/01_unit/app/desugar/trait_group_from_execution_spec.spl (2/5 -> 5/5 PASS), and added trait_group_with_dispatch_and_desugar_spec.spl (3/3 PASS) proving native trait G with A, B dispatch (SUM=23), pub trait group lowering, and G.from(core) -> G__from(core) rewriting with match (zero if val). Verified 35/35 PASS across trait_desugar_from_match_spec (3/3), trait_group_spec (24/24), trait_group_from_execution_spec (5/5), and trait_group_with_dispatch_and_desugar_spec (3/3). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/app/desugar/trait_group_from_execution_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/app/desugar/trait_group_with_dispatch_and_desugar_spec.spl"
